{"parse": {"title": "河港与海之间-05", "pageid": 88862, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-04\" title=\"河港与海之间-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">河港与海之间-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-06\" title=\"河港与海之间-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">河港与海之间</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.8D.E5.8F.AF.E6.8B.86.E5.8D.B8.E4.B9.8B.E7.89.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"不可拆卸之物\">不可拆卸之物</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 不可拆卸之物</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Indivisible</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>演奏前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>演奏后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_wutai\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_wutai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不算大的场地边缘挤满了人，将最中央的区域留给即将登场的乐手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有乐手之中，一位小姑娘吸引了最多的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>呼……放轻松……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>过了今天，我就收拾所有行李，仔细数着船儿回来的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>指法，谱子，持琴的姿势……肯定都不会出错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>乐器……也没问题。“啪唧匣子”现在的状态比之前都要好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旁人的视线压得她手里的乐器稍显沉重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她早就习惯了被注视，又挺了挺脊背，将琴在肩上托得稳当了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>爸爸妈妈和巴蒂斯塔先生一定都会为我的新作品大吃一惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这首曲子还带着海风的味道，就像从意大利开始航行，一直到踏上澳大利亚的港口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>既然大家都没有时间出去，我至少可以帮他们把别处的声音带来～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">制琴学徒：</div><div>下一位，芭卡洛儿小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">制琴学徒：</div><div>我们最年轻的小音乐家，斯特拉迪瓦里的骄傲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">制琴学徒：</div><div>我就不在这儿重复她学琴路上取得的成就了，只要记住，她的琴声甚至能让波河的鱼儿主动跳上河岸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那只是个误会！太夸张了，那天正好快要下雨，而且——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">制琴学徒：</div><div>让我们瞧瞧芭卡洛儿小姐能否顺利拿下今年的最高分！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">制琴学徒：</div><div>请走上前来，展示您的小提琴。让我们一睹它优雅的琴颈，闪烁的光泽，来自特拉迪瓦里最顶尖的制琴工艺……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">制琴学徒：</div><div>……就是您手中这把吗，您确定？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>是的，这就是我的琴。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_weixiao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_weixiao\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_weixiao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-2_4_at_weixiao.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_weixiao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-2_4_at_weixiao.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_weixiao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-2_4_at_weixiao.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_weixiao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这次她没有犹豫，自然地将琴提在手中，举起它好让最角落的人也能看清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群陷入了微妙的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>父亲和母亲挑选的木头非常优秀，它的音色丰富、平衡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>调制琴漆、调试琴弦、打磨边沿、修正琴身的弧度，这些都花去了他们不少时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>参加考试的孩子大多会选择仿照家人的范例，自己重新制作一把小提琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为另一个选项几乎走不通。对已有的琴进行合理改良，实际上比从头开始更困难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>无论按怎样的标准，它都足够完美。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>但对演奏者而言，最好的乐器是适合自己的乐器，而不是合规矩的精巧摆件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我不打算再做一把精美的复制品，也很喜欢这把始终陪伴我的琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>所以我选择稍做修改，让它更契合我的演奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>它现在还不是完成品，因为我会不断尝试将新的乐器和它组合，直到找到最合适的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>接下来，我会用它为大家带来一首崭新的乐曲。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_wutai\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_wutai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在一片静默中，她举起琴弓。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">音乐家：</div><div>多么新鲜～我从来没见过这样的琴，也从未听过这样的乐声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">收藏家：</div><div>我们淘气的小姑娘带着自己宝贝的玩具站上了舞台，真惹人怜爱，不是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">收藏家：</div><div>克里斯先生，我敢打包票，像她这么大的时候，你绝没有这样的勇气～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">音乐家：</div><div>哈哈哈，等她长大之后，保准会成为比我更出色的的小提琴乐手！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，房间里终于有了新的动静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>规律而礼貌，节奏平稳的掌声汹涌而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从那些客气的微笑中，她能够读出这场考试的结果。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>异想天开、无法被普遍使用、不会被轻易接受……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>他们从没有正视过我的“啪唧匣子”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>他们就是觉得这样的琴卖不出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……难道每个小提琴工匠的目标都是把琴卖到更多地方吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>也许我就是不适合待在这儿，“小提琴之都”，没有一点留给其他东西的空隙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小姑娘蜷缩在长椅上，摆弄着写有考试结果的纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几经翻折之后，它变成了一枚规整的纸飞机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你瞧，你只是一张纸而已。尽管你的沙沙声很有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>一张纸怎么能给我今天之前的生活作总结呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我要离开克雷莫纳，你就留在这里的不知道哪个角落吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>三，二，一……嘿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸飞机平稳地滑出教堂大门，消失在芭卡洛儿的视线中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>连带着消失的还有那个“不合格”的结果，以及她的犹豫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身子，透过彩窗的光晃得她有些视线模糊。但她很快稳住了脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我或许还会回到这里，或许不会啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>等我在船上待一段时间，下次在克雷莫纳靠岸的时候，可能我还是会回家瞧瞧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那时候它应该还是“小提琴之都”，斯特拉迪瓦里也依然是享有盛名的制琴家族。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>面对我这个不合格的成员，大家会说些什么呢？他们会不会想念我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手轻轻抚上陈旧的长椅，感受上面深刻的木质纹路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>再也没有人愿意用粘合咒替你修补一些小东西，也没有人会把你的声音录下来，编进曲子啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你还会在这里吗？会有人来把你的长椅打理干净，擦拭你彩色的玻璃吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我们应该好好地道个别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教堂依然沉默，周遭只有一串走向门口的脚步声。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>真的？你真的决定要加入“自由海风号”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>天哪，这真是太……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我知道这有点突然，你们之前都没把聊天时的话当真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>但是，如果船上现在还缺乐手，我很希望能加入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>真是太好了！我和他们打赌来着，这下赢的硬币够在港口吃好几顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>也请你们尝尝这里的特色菜——别客气，就当是庆祝新伙伴到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这还只是我的个人决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>而且我还没有正式见过船长，万一我也没通过游轮乐队的考核……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>你遇见什么难过的事了吗，芭卡洛儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>……关于你的那场考试？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朋友察觉到了她的情绪不同往日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>就像你说的，这证明不了什么，只是为一位制琴师提供足够的名声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>这些名声会支持着他们，直到他们成长得足够撑起一家新作坊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>但你本来就不打算那么做，对吗？你不需要这份证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我的父母和老师需要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>他们觉得我在浪费自己的天分，也认为我没有好好对待这份礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她挪开了攥住琴颈的那只手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在这是一把优雅、美丽、寻常的小提琴了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-520612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-520612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-520612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>你把琴拆开了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>别这样，芭卡洛儿，你不是试了很久才找出改造“啪唧匣子”的方法吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我尝试过，那时我不舍得拆掉它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我现在才发现，要把粘合咒粘好的物体分离开，比让它们紧紧贴在一起更困难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这是我很早之前试着做的和“啪唧匣子”相似的琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那时候我还一心想着要继承作坊，要做斯特拉迪瓦里家族最优秀的制琴师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我把它留给爸爸妈妈，他们或许会收下，也会没那么生气……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>至少我证明了我能够做到，我只是不想开一家制琴作坊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>明天我就会把所有事情和他们讲清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>现在——我希望你们能为我的演奏加油。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>走吧，我想到了能打动船长的曲子。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "河港与海之间-05"}}